  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Tsunami Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2016, ActionAid Australia has been working with women&apos;s rights organization, the Talitha Project, in Tonga as part of the Shifting the Power Coalition, which aims to promote Pacific women&apos;s leadership in response to disasters and climate change.  With training and resources from the Coalition, the Talitha Project is responding to the urgent needs facing young women and girls during this crisis by providing water, food, toilet paper, masks and dignity kits.</narrative>
  </description>
